<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<body style="font-family: sans-serif; color: #374151; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 16px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;">You've been invited to MonacoTool</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Hi {{ user.name ?? user.email }},</p>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 24px;">You've been invited to join the team <strong>{{ team.name }}</strong>. Click the button below to set up your account and accept the invitation.</p>
    <a href="{{ url }}"
       style="display: inline-block; background: #4f46e5; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: 10px 24px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600;">
        Set up my account
    </a>
    <p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #6b7280;">
        This invitation expires in 7 days. If you were not expecting this, you can safely ignore this email.
    </p>
</body>
</html>
